WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.519
Progress shows your XP, your level and your streak.

00:00:03.519 --> 00:00:06.003
Levels come from small, steady wins.

00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:09.799
There is a daily cap on XP, so nobody grinds all night.

00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:11.938
Streaks forgive two quiet days.

00:00:11.938 --> 00:00:17.527
And My Vibe lets you change the look, the sounds and how often the app pings you.

00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:19.735
It is your app, set up your way.

00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:22.909
Try it now: open My Vibe and change one thing.

